Eager to aid their allies, members of every race in Azeroth rush to the Gulch to lend sword, or spell, to the conflict.', 16712190, 'A valley Bordering Ashenvale Forest and the Barrens, Warsong Gulch hosts a constant battle between the Horde and Alliance.

